(text "Regenerated from the baseline netlist (tag baseline-2026-11-23-locked) with\nthe Phase 2 pin re-use: PC10/PC11/PC12 = SPI3 SCK/MISO/MOSI (AF6) slot bus;\nPE0/PE1/PD11 = slot CS decoder A0-A2, PD13 = decoder enable (100k pull-down =\nno slot selected); PC9 = SLOT_RST_N (100k pull-down = slots held in reset);\nPB4 = SLOT_EXP_INT_N; PB10/PB11 = I2C2 SCL/SDA (AF4, DS12110 rev 10) for the\nslot ID bus; PA? MUXB_OUT ADC pin = SLOT_ANA. DI5-DI12 MCU pins are free (DI-8\ncard serialises them). Baseline sheet notes:\ndocs/modular/mainboard_sheet_notes.md." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 313.69 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f63e2119-1b84-4a08-9e91-e66d6f545195"))
(embedded_fonts no))
